# Linear / Slack / pipeline notifications

## Gate first

Only trigger Linear status transitions and Slack **success** notifications **after** the parity gate has genuinely passed (`report.gatePassed === true`).

- No PR open → no Slack "PR opened" notify → no Linear **In Review** move on a failed gate.
- On parity-gate or post-parity/PR failure, move the ticket to **Blocked**, halt, and post the appropriate failure comment — do not invent a success path.
- Stage-throw failures retry via **Ready** up to `PIPELINE_MAX_STAGE_RETRIES` (default 3); after that, move to **Blocked**.

## Keep existing formats

Use the existing helpers and payload/comment builders already in these files (e.g. `buildInReviewComment`, `buildParityFailedComment`, `notifyPrOpened`, `updateTicketStatus`, `addIssueComment`).

Do **not** introduce a new comment or Slack payload format alongside them.
